# Title: Suspicious File Downloaded From Direct IP Via Certutil.EXE
# ID: 13e6fe51-d478-4c7e-b0f2-6da9b400a829
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-02-15
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
# Description: Detects the execution of certutil with certain flags that allow the utility to download files from direct IPs.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((CommandLine CONTAIN "urlcache " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "verifyctl " OR CommandLine CONTAIN "URL ")) AND ((CommandLine CONTAIN "://1" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://2" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://3" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://4" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://5" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://6" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://7" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://8" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://9")) AND ((Image="*\\certutil.exe") OR (OriginalFileName = "CertUtil.exe"))) AND NOT ((CommandLine CONTAIN "://7-")))
